      "html": "<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"spartan-plumbing-hero\" class=\"spartan-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto gap-8 pb-24 max-md:pb-12 section-shell--nav-clearance section-shell--nav-clearance-with-padding section-shell--fluid-mobile-padding\" style=\"--section-shell-padding-top:13rem;--section-shell-padding-top-mobile:6rem;\"><p class=\"text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">Home services · Google Search Ads</p><h1 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-5xl max-md:leading-none max-md:tracking-display text-6xl\"><span class=\"block text-spark\">Spartan Plumbing</span><span class=\"block text-slatecolor\">Search ads. Real jobs.</span></h1><nav class=\"spartan-case-navigation\" aria-label=\"Case study sections\"><a href=\"#spartan-plumbing-overview\">Results overview</a><a href=\"#spartan-plumbing-approach\">Our approach</a><a href=\"#spartan-plumbing-results\">Campaign data</a><a href=\"#spartan-plumbing-measurement\">How to read the figures</a></nav></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"spartan-plumbing-overview\" class=\"spartan-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-6 max-md:py-4\" ><div class=\"bw-dashboard spartan-charts\"><div class=\"bw-dashboard-header\"><div><h2 class=\"bw-dashboard-heading\">Spartan Plumbing · Performance overview</h2><p class=\"bw-dashboard-period\">July 1–31, 2026</p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"bw-dashboard-replay\" data-bw-replay hidden aria-label=\"Replay Spartan Plumbing charts\">Replay</button></div><div class=\"bw-dashboard-grid\"><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-wide sp-dark\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sp-revenue-title\" data-sp-chart=\"revenue\"><h3 id=\"sp-revenue-title\">Monthly company revenue</h3><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">$506,000</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">$<span data-bw-counter=\"506\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">506</span>k</span></p><div class=\"sp-revenue-plot\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Monthly company revenue: typical month approximately $320,000; July 2026 $506,000. Both bars start at zero on a $600,000 scale.\"><div class=\"sp-column\"><div class=\"sp-column-track\"><div class=\"sp-column-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-height:106.66666667px\" data-bw-bar=\"vertical\" data-sp-value=\"320000\" data-sp-maximum=\"600000\"></div></div><p class=\"sp-plot-value\">~$320k</p><p class=\"sp-plot-label\">Typical month</p></div><div class=\"sp-column\"><div class=\"sp-column-track\"><div class=\"sp-column-bar sp-column-bar--current\" style=\"--sp-bar-height:168.66666667px\" data-bw-bar=\"vertical\" data-sp-value=\"506000\" data-sp-maximum=\"600000\"></div></div><p class=\"sp-plot-value\">$506k</p><p class=\"sp-plot-label\">July 2026</p></div></div><div class=\"sp-axis\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Zero baseline</span><span>$600k scale</span></div></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-narrow sp-peach\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sp-growth-title\"><h3 id=\"sp-growth-title\">Above the typical month</h3><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">Approximately 58 percent higher</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+<span data-bw-counter=\"58\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">58</span>%</span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">Compared with the trailing monthly average</p><p class=\"sp-derived\">About $186k higher.</p><p class=\"sp-note\">Calculated from the rounded revenue figures. The comparison baseline is approximate.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-narrow sp-blue\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sp-spend-title\"><h3 id=\"sp-spend-title\">Google Ads spend</h3><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">$33,700</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">$<span data-bw-counter=\"33.7\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">33.7</span>k</span></p><p class=\"sp-note\">This is media spend for the reporting period.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-wide sp-green\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sp-sales-title\"><h3 id=\"sp-sales-title\">Business sales</h3><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">$512,000</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">$<span data-bw-counter=\"512\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">512</span>k</span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">Total reported sales</p><p class=\"sp-derived\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">Approximately 15 to 1</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"15.0\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">15.0</span>×</span> company revenue / Ads spend</p><p class=\"sp-note\">A blended business ratio. It does not establish Ads-attributed return on ad spend.</p></article></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"spartan-plumbing-brief\" class=\"spartan-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-6 text-left\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl text-spark\">The brief</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\"><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">At Fyntix, we focused Spartan Plumbing’s Google Search activity on brand demand, service intent and phone-call conversions. The aim was to connect the right search with a useful customer conversation.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">For a service business, a marketing result has several stages. Someone first needs to recognise that help is available for their problem. They then need enough confidence to make contact, a team able to handle that enquiry, and a service that can turn the conversation into completed work. Our starting point was to treat those stages as one business problem while keeping their measurements separate.</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"spartan-plumbing-challenge\" class=\"spartan-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-6 text-left\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl text-spark\">Why focus mattered</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\"><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">The legacy account contained more than 30 campaigns, and business revenue had not broken out for roughly 18 months.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">Complexity can make a paid-search account difficult to evaluate. When many ideas compete for attention, it becomes harder to explain which audience a campaign serves, which action it should produce and why it deserves more budget. A clearer structure gives each campaign a job. It also makes a disappointing result easier to investigate, because the team can ask a precise question instead of changing several unrelated things at once.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">Our priority was therefore a more useful decision framework. Brand demand and service demand answer different customer needs. Looking at them separately helps a team judge whether it is reaching people who already know the business or introducing the offer to someone searching for a solution. That distinction matters when interpreting both response rates and acquisition costs.</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"spartan-plumbing-approach\" class=\"spartan-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-6 text-left\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl text-spark\">How we shaped the account</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\"><h3 class=\"mt-6 mb-3 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">Organise around the customer’s need</h3><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">We concentrated on brand, core-service and local searches, using target-CPA bidding around call conversions.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">The principle behind that focus is relevance. A person researching a specific problem should be able to recognise the relevant service without translating a broad marketing promise into their own situation. For us, campaign structure is a way to keep that relationship clear: the search expresses a need, the message addresses it, and the next action moves the customer towards help.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">This also creates a better basis for reviewing performance. A brand campaign and a service campaign can attract different kinds of searcher, so their click rates and costs deserve context. The purpose of comparison is to understand their roles and decide what to examine next. A single average cannot explain every part of the account.</p><h3 class=\"mt-6 mb-3 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">Choose a meaningful conversion signal</h3><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\"><a href=\"https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/6268632?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline underline-offset-2\">Target CPA</a> uses conversion data and auction signals to pursue a desired average cost per action. The selected action therefore matters. A target is an input to bidding, while the cost actually achieved is an outcome to evaluate. Some conversions can cost more and others less than the target; individual conversion costs can vary around the average.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">For a phone-led service, the distinction between a contact attempt, a substantive conversation and a booked appointment is useful. Each is a different stage of the customer journey. A report should make the selected measurement visible so that the marketing team and the people handling enquiries are discussing the same outcome. Shared definitions give sales and marketing a common target and make follow-up decisions clearer.</p><h3 class=\"mt-6 mb-3 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">Give budget decisions a commercial context</h3><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">Budget concentration makes the review more focused: which demand deserves protection, where is efficiency strongest, and what evidence would justify another increment of spend? Those questions encourage a team to look beyond the largest traffic number. They also keep service capacity and enquiry handling in the conversation, because buying more attention is useful only when the business can respond effectively.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\"><a href=\"https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/2497703?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline underline-offset-2\">Impression share</a> describes visibility against estimated eligible impressions. It can indicate room to reach more searches; the commercial value depends on the resulting enquiries and jobs. We treat a budget constraint as a reason to investigate the next test, with acquisition cost, lead quality and operational capacity considered together.</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"spartan-plumbing-results\" class=\"spartan-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-12 max-md:py-6\" ><div class=\"bw-dashboard spartan-charts\"><div class=\"bw-dashboard-header\"><div><h2 class=\"bw-dashboard-heading\">Campaign performance, in detail</h2><p class=\"bw-dashboard-period\">Activity, efficiency and business outcomes</p></div></div><div class=\"bw-dashboard-grid\"><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-full sp-white\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sp-activity-title\"><h3 id=\"sp-activity-title\">What the account recorded</h3><div class=\"sp-stat-strip\"><div><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">33,396</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"33396\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">33,396</span></span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">Impressions</p></div><div><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">1,639</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"1639\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">1,639</span></span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">Clicks</p></div><div><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">74</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"74\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">74</span></span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">Tracked phone calls</p></div><div><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">Approximately 210 total conversions</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">~<span data-bw-counter=\"210\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">210</span></span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">Total conversions</p></div></div><p class=\"sp-note\">Tracked calls and total conversions are separate reported measures. A conversion-type breakdown is not available here.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-wide sp-peach\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sp-impressions-title\" data-sp-chart=\"campaign-impressions\"><h3 id=\"sp-impressions-title\">Selected campaign impressions</h3><ul class=\"sp-bars\"><li><div class=\"sp-bar-label\"><span>Brand Search</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">13,828</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"13828\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">13,828</span></span></strong></div><div class=\"sp-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sp-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-width:86.42500000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sp-value=\"13828\" data-sp-maximum=\"16000\"></div></div></li><li><div class=\"sp-bar-label\"><span>Drain Cleaning</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">4,382</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"4382\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">4,382</span></span></strong></div><div class=\"sp-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sp-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-width:27.38750000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sp-value=\"4382\" data-sp-maximum=\"16000\"></div></div></li><li><div class=\"sp-bar-label\"><span>Plumbers by City</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">3,701</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"3701\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">3,701</span></span></strong></div><div class=\"sp-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sp-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-width:23.13125000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sp-value=\"3701\" data-sp-maximum=\"16000\"></div></div></li></ul><div class=\"sp-axis\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>0</span><span>16,000</span></div><p class=\"sp-note\">Selected groups only; the bars do not represent the full account total.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-narrow sp-blue\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sp-ctr-title\" data-sp-chart=\"ctr\"><h3 id=\"sp-ctr-title\">Click-through rates</h3><ul class=\"sp-bars\"><li><div class=\"sp-bar-label\"><span>Whole account</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">4.91%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"4.91\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"2\">4.91</span>%</span></strong></div><div class=\"sp-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sp-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-width:81.83333333%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sp-value=\"4.91\" data-sp-maximum=\"6\"></div></div></li><li><div class=\"sp-bar-label\"><span>Brand Search</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">4.69%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"4.69\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"2\">4.69</span>%</span></strong></div><div class=\"sp-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sp-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-width:78.16666667%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sp-value=\"4.69\" data-sp-maximum=\"6\"></div></div></li><li><div class=\"sp-bar-label\"><span>Drain Cleaning</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">2.74%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"2.74\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"2\">2.74</span>%</span></strong></div><div class=\"sp-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sp-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-width:45.66666667%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sp-value=\"2.74\" data-sp-maximum=\"6\"></div></div></li></ul><div class=\"sp-axis\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>0%</span><span>6%</span></div><p class=\"sp-note\">Each rate uses its own impressions as the denominator.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-wide sp-dark\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sp-cpa-title\" data-sp-chart=\"cpa\"><h3 id=\"sp-cpa-title\">Cost per conversion</h3><ul class=\"sp-bars\"><li><div class=\"sp-bar-label\"><span>Blended account</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">$160.84</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">$<span data-bw-counter=\"160.84\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"2\">160.84</span></span></strong></div><div class=\"sp-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sp-bar sp-bar--muted\" style=\"--sp-bar-width:80.42000000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sp-value=\"160.84\" data-sp-maximum=\"200\"></div></div></li><li><div class=\"sp-bar-label\"><span>Brand Search</span><strong><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">$108</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">$<span data-bw-counter=\"108\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">108</span></span></strong></div><div class=\"sp-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"sp-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-width:54.00000000%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sp-value=\"108\" data-sp-maximum=\"200\"></div></div></li></ul><div class=\"sp-axis\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>$0</span><span>$200</span></div><p class=\"sp-derived\">Brand CPA was about 33% lower.</p><p class=\"sp-note\">Lower is better for this cost comparison. The percentage is calculated from the reported, rounded Brand Search CPA.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-narrow sp-peach\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sp-booking-title\" data-sp-chart=\"booking\"><h3 id=\"sp-booking-title\">Call-booking rate</h3><div class=\"sp-ring\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 144 144\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle class=\"sp-ring-track\" cx=\"72\" cy=\"72\" r=\"56\"/><circle class=\"sp-ring-progress\" cx=\"72\" cy=\"72\" r=\"56\" transform=\"rotate(-90 72 72)\" stroke-dasharray=\"313.153955709831 38.704421492226\" data-bw-ring data-bw-ring-circumference=\"351.858377202057\" data-bw-ring-arc=\"313.153955709831\" data-sp-percent=\"89\"/></svg><p class=\"sp-ring-value\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">89%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"89\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">89</span>%</span></p></div><p class=\"bw-card-description sp-ring-description\">Calls converted into scheduled jobs</p><p class=\"sp-note\">A reported business rate; no booked-job count is inferred from the tracked-call total.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-narrow sp-green\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sp-closing-title\" data-sp-chart=\"closing\"><h3 id=\"sp-closing-title\">Close rate</h3><div class=\"sp-ring\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 144 144\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle class=\"sp-ring-track\" cx=\"72\" cy=\"72\" r=\"56\"/><circle class=\"sp-ring-progress\" cx=\"72\" cy=\"72\" r=\"56\" transform=\"rotate(-90 72 72)\" stroke-dasharray=\"218.152193865275 133.706183336782\" data-bw-ring data-bw-ring-circumference=\"351.858377202057\" data-bw-ring-arc=\"218.152193865275\" data-sp-percent=\"62\"/></svg><p class=\"sp-ring-value\"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">62%</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"62\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">62</span>%</span></p></div><p class=\"bw-card-description sp-ring-description\">Scheduled jobs won</p><p class=\"sp-note\">This rate has a different denominator from call booking.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-narrow sp-blue\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sp-ticket-title\"><h3 id=\"sp-ticket-title\">Average sale</h3><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">$2,767</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">$<span data-bw-counter=\"2767\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">2,767</span></span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">Per completed job</p><p class=\"sp-note\">A reported business average, presented separately from advertising cost.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-narrow sp-white\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sp-customers-title\" data-sp-chart=\"satisfaction\"><h3 id=\"sp-customers-title\">Customer outcomes</h3><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">4.9 out of 5</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"4.9\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">4.9</span> / 5</span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">Customer satisfaction</p><div class=\"sp-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"sp-bar sp-bar--ink\" style=\"--sp-bar-width:98%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sp-value=\"4.9\" data-sp-maximum=\"5\"></div></div><div class=\"sp-secondary-stat\"><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">18</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bw-counter=\"18\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">18</span></span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">New memberships</p></div></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-wide sp-white\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sp-measurement-title\"><h3 id=\"sp-measurement-title\">Business results and platform reporting</h3><div class=\"sp-value-pair\"><div><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">$38,800</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">$<span data-bw-counter=\"38.8\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"1\">38.8</span>k</span></p><p class=\"sp-value-label\">Ads-tracked conversion value</p></div><div><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">$506,000</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">$<span data-bw-counter=\"506\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">506</span>k</span></p><p class=\"sp-value-label\">Company revenue</p></div></div><p class=\"sp-note\">Different measurement scopes. The gap does not by itself identify additional revenue attributable to Ads.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-narrow sp-peach\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sp-budget-title\" data-sp-chart=\"budget\"><h3 id=\"sp-budget-title\">Room for a controlled next test</h3><p class=\"bw-figure \"><span class=\"bw-sr-only\">Approximately 30 percent</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">~<span data-bw-counter=\"30\" data-bw-counter-from=\"0\" data-bw-decimals=\"0\">30</span>%</span></p><p class=\"bw-card-description\">Core search opportunity lost to budget</p><div class=\"sp-bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><div class=\"sp-bar\" style=\"--sp-bar-width:30%\" data-bw-bar=\"horizontal\" data-sp-value=\"30\" data-sp-maximum=\"100\"></div></div><p class=\"sp-note\">The remainder is not labelled as captured share. Budget-limited visibility does not translate directly into an equivalent revenue uplift.</p></article><article class=\"bw-dashboard-card sp-full sp-white\" data-bw-animate aria-labelledby=\"sp-table-title\"><h3 id=\"sp-table-title\">The campaign detail</h3><div class=\"sp-table-wrap\"><table><caption>Selected campaigns · July 2026. — means not reported.</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Campaign</th><th scope=\"col\">Impressions</th><th scope=\"col\">Clicks</th><th scope=\"col\">CTR</th><th scope=\"col\">Cost / conversion</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Brand Search</th><td>13,828</td><td>649</td><td>4.69%</td><td>$108</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Drain Cleaning</th><td>4,382</td><td>120</td><td>2.74%</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Plumbers by City</th><td>3,701</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr><th scope=\"row\">Whole account</th><td>33,396</td><td>1,639</td><td>4.91%</td><td>$160.84</td></tr></tfoot></table></div><p class=\"sp-note\">The account row includes campaigns beyond the selected groups. Missing values are not zero. Other service themes included sewer inspection and water-line or pipe-burst demand.</p></article></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"spartan-plumbing-interpretation\" class=\"spartan-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-6 text-left\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl text-spark\">Reading the performance</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\"><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\"><a href=\"https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/2615875?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline underline-offset-2\">Click-through rate</a> is clicks divided by impressions. It describes the response to an ad’s appearance, rather than the number of jobs completed. In this dashboard, the campaign comparisons help explain where that response differed. They should be read alongside the campaign’s purpose and the quality of the resulting enquiries, rather than used as a standalone ranking of commercial value.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\"><a href=\"https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/6396841?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline underline-offset-2\">Average cost per conversion</a> divides cost by recorded conversions. It is useful when the conversion definition is clear and comparable. A lower cost can be encouraging, but the business still needs to understand what the action represents. Looking at a cost measure beside average sale value gives commercial context. Job margins and the share of enquiries that become completed work complete that picture.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">The business rates add another layer. Booking concerns the move from a call to scheduled work; closing concerns the outcome of scheduled opportunities. Keeping the two denominators visible makes it easier to identify a useful question for the team. It also avoids turning rounded percentages into invented counts or drawing a funnel whose stages have not been matched to the same customer cohort.</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"spartan-plumbing-measurement\" class=\"spartan-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-6 text-left\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl text-spark\">How to read the figures</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\"><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">The revenue comparison uses a typical-month baseline and one reported month. The uplift describes the difference between those values, while the business ratio compares company revenue with media spend for the period. Matching individual bookings and completed jobs to their originating campaigns would provide a richer view of advertising attribution and help the team judge repeatability.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">A platform report and a business revenue ledger answer different questions. <a href=\"https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/6301373?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline underline-offset-2\">Google’s call-conversion guidance</a> explains how call outcomes can be matched back to advertising activity when appropriate tracking and import processes are in place. Those capabilities offer a practical path to a more complete, reconciled view of offline outcomes.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">For our presentation, each financial figure carries its scope beside it. Company revenue describes the business outcome; the platform value describes the conversions recorded there. Matching those records would allow a clearer campaign-level view. A strong month then becomes the starting point for useful questions about repeatability, budget allocation and the quality of the next set of enquiries.</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"spartan-plumbing-next\" class=\"spartan-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-6 text-left\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl text-spark\">Where we would go next</h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--delta flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\"><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">The next decision would be a controlled scaling test, with the existing measurement definitions agreed before more budget is committed. We would review which service demand is constrained, whether enquiry handling can support additional volume, and how the next increment changes acquisition cost and job quality. The team can then compare each test against the same definitions and decide what to repeat, improve or stop.</p><p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor\">For us, the value of the work is a clearer commercial conversation. Search visibility, response, bookings and business revenue each have a place in it. Bringing them into one readable account helps a team recognise progress, question a weak assumption and choose the next action with a better understanding of what the numbers actually say.</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\"><section data-v-1c6297c3 id=\"spartan-plumbing-cta\" class=\"spartan-case-section px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pointer-events-auto py-24 max-md:py-10\" ><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col items-start gap-6\"><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight text-4xl text-slatecolor\">Let’s make your next enquiry count.</h2><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-charcoal px-6 py-3 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight text-chalk\">Book a free strategy call</a></div></section></div>"
    },
